        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðæt isen ðe bið to ðrimfealdum ordale, þæt wege III pund.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The iron for the triple ordeal shall weigh three pounds.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ferrum, quod facit ad triplex ordalium, debet ponderare LX solidos.</ab>
